   ""\
   "- If you encounter innocent workers, secure them or find more precise or non lethal means to retrieve them. CQB is prohibited near hostages."\
   "- Some OPFOR/INDFOR may surrender if things look dire. Secure them and move on."\
   "- Extract VIPs to spawn"
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{64425051B9B5AF67}" {
   m_sTitle "OPFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "You must race race to the oil rig + ships and attempt to kidnap VIPs for ransom and extract them to your spawn."\
   ""\
   "Special Behavior:"\
   "- If you are caught in a CQB engagement with 2 or less within a squad, you are to verbally call for your own surrender. No bluffing."\
   "- You are allowed to use hostages to secure a bottleneck/halt pending CQB from Blufor. Make sure to vocalize."\
   ""
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
